  "description": "The CXR 9.2 combines our new high modulus C10 carbon frame and fork with a SRAM Force CX1 groupset to make a ready to race bike that’s hard to beat. We’ve refined the frame and fork with feedback from our sponsored athletes, increasing tyre clearances and designing a brand new fork to improve handling in tight corners.\n\nWith tubeless ready CXR Elite Five wheels and 33mm Clement MXP tyres, ditching inner tubes is as easy as adding sealant, meaning low pressures for high grip in the sloppy mud are possible without the risk of pinch flats. A 11 speed SRAM Force CX1 groupset gives a great spread of gears without the complexity of a front derailleur, and with powerful hydraulic disc brakes, you can conquer any corner or descent with confidence and control.",
